00:34:12,739 --> 00:34:17,239
「ウタを知ってから、数日が経った」
[Text: It has been a few days since I learned about music.]

229
00:34:17,739 --> 00:34:24,239
「旅路は進み、ようやく光の塔がぼろぼろながらに見えてくる」
[Text: The journey continues, and the Tower of Light finally comes into view, though battered.]

230
00:34:24,439 --> 00:34:31,039
「だけど「オンガク」や「ウタ」について知っている人は、ほとんどいなかった」
[Text: But almost no one knew anything about "music" or "songs".]

231
00:34:31,239 --> 00:34:37,239
「もしかしたらあたしは、ないものねだりをしているだけなのかもしれない」
[Text: Perhaps I was just wishing for things that didn't exist.]

232
00:34:37,739 --> 00:34:42,039
「でも……新しい出会いはあった」
[Text: But... I found a new encounter.]

233
00:34:43,739 --> 00:34:47,239
Ciaoooo! I'm Raora Panthera!

234
00:34:47,739 --> 00:34:51,239
あたし、絵描きをやってるんだー！
I'm an artist!

235
00:34:51,739 --> 00:34:55,239
きみを見たとき、ピビビッてきたの！きみにはこれが似合いそう！
When I saw you, I got a spark! This looks like it would suit you!

236
00:34:55,739 --> 00:34:59,239
さらさらさらさら…っと
Swipe, swipe, swipe...

237
00:34:59,739 --> 00:35:04,739
ほら、はい、プレゼント！
Here, take it, a present!

238
00:35:03,054 --> 00:35:04,184
はい、プレゼント！
Here, a present!

239
00:35:04,744 --> 00:35:06,284
これ…あたし？
This... is me?

240
00:35:06,804 --> 00:35:12,044
うん、ステージ衣装を着た、キミの絵！So cute…！！
Yep, a drawing of you in your stage outfit! So cute...!!

241
00:35:12,844 --> 00:35:16,044
ちょっと、あたしにはかわいすぎない？
Isn't this a little too cute for me?

242
00:35:16,544 --> 00:35:20,244
そんなことないよ！すっごくぴったり！
Not at all! It fits you perfectly!

243
00:35:20,704 --> 00:35:22,724
そ、そうかな…？
Y-You think...?

244
00:35:23,424 --> 00:35:29,444
きみはこのステージ衣装を着て…Let's sing with me!!
You're gonna wear this stage outfit and... Let's sing with me!!

245
00:35:51,804 --> 00:35:54,444
YEAH~

246
00:35:54,444 --> 00:35:57,744
YEAH~

247
00:36:05,484 --> 00:36:12,044
The knacks of surviving in this world are being human and being right

248
00:36:12,844 --> 00:36:18,444
Everyone keeps telling me to grow up fast and it is so tough can't wrap my head around it

249
00:36:19,244 --> 00:36:23,944
Your unfair rules, ego trip into a loop, we do belong nowhere in this world

250
00:36:24,744 --> 00:36:30,644
Yet we are surviving, getting through anything, stay alive

251
00:36:32,744 --> 00:36:43,744
Hated ones, Naked hearts, worthless games that never end, found them in the darkness in the end

252
00:36:44,744 --> 00:36:58,144
何が正しくて何が間違って生きるんだ　僕はただここで生きてると叫びたいだけ
What is right and what is wrong as I live my life... I just want to scream out that I'm alive right here!

253
00:36:58,844 --> 00:37:05,244
I heard voices calling out my true name, I will never give up or be swayed anymore

254
00:37:05,744 --> 00:37:15,944
Nobody can stop me, this is the way I am, I'll EXECUTE you, drop dead baby!! YEAH~

255
00:37:26,944 --> 00:37:33,744
Everyone wanna choose the right path only, they would seek salvation in this closed world

256
00:37:34,244 --> 00:37:40,644
Filthy hands and mind never get clean again though, and it is so tough can't wrap my head around it

257
00:37:40,744 --> 00:37:53,744
Cannot turn the clock back, cannot take a turn back, we do belong nowhere in this world, yet we are surviving, getting through anything, stay alive

258
00:37:54,744 --> 00:38:05,444
Missing piece, warmth of hands, joys and even stabbing pains, found them in the darkness in the end

259
00:38:06,244 --> 00:38:19,744
何が正しくて何が間違って生きるんだ　誰だってここで生きてると叫んでいるのに
What is right and what is wrong as I live my life... Even though everyone is screaming that they're alive right here!

260
00:38:20,444 --> 00:38:27,444
Facing what they really want to do, they'll make it at the cost of everything

261
00:38:27,944 --> 00:38:38,444
Nobody can stop me, this is the way I am, I'll EXECUTE you, drop dead baby!! YEAH~

262
00:39:02,744 --> 00:39:17,444
また失って、もう嫌になって、それでも消えなくて、その心の名をなんと言うのだろう
Losing things again, getting so sick of it, yet unable to make it disappear... What would you call that name in your heart?

263
00:39:17,744 --> 00:39:31,444
僕はここで今叫んでいるんだよ　君だってここで同じように叫んでいるんだろう
I am screaming out right here, right now... Just like you are screaming out right here in the same way!

264
00:39:31,944 --> 00:39:46,444
I heard voices calling out my true name, I will never give up or be swayed anymore, nobody can stop me, this is the way I am, I'll EXECUTE you, drop dead baby!!

265
00:39:46,444 --> 00:39:59,144
YEAH~ So, this is the way I am, YEAH~

266
00:40:10,637 --> 00:40:17,597
(色とりどりのかわいらしい「衣装」 それは不思議とぴったりと身体に馴染んでいた)
(A colorful and lovely outfit... Strangely enough, it fit my body like a second skin.)

267
00:40:18,457 --> 00:40:24,117
「衣装」を身にまい、「ヘッドセット」をつけて、「歌う」あたし
(I put on the outfit, put on the headset, and became myself, singing.)

268
00:40:24,997 --> 00:40:31,197
(あっちのあたしと、今のあたし、どっちが本物なんだろう)
(The me from back then, and the me now... Which one is the real me?)

269
00:40:33,557 --> 00:40:40,117
そういう時はね、難しいことは忘れて、ぱーっと楽しいことをするに限るかなぁ。
Whenever that happens, the best thing to do is forget all the difficult stuff and just have a blast!

270
00:40:40,257 --> 00:40:50,537
クレープを焼いたりとか、アロママで癒されたりとか、ベリーダンスを踊ったりとかして気持ちよくなれば、悩み事なんてどこかに飛んでいっちゃうものなんだよ。
Like baking crepes, getting healed by aromas, or dancing belly dance—if you feel good, all your worries will just fly away somewhere.

271
00:40:51,337 --> 00:40:52,757
そういうものなの？
Is that how it works?

272
00:40:53,857 --> 00:40:55,937
うん、そういうものかなぁ。
Yep, something like that.

273
00:40:56,457 --> 00:41:02,797
だって世の中の大体のことは、それがどう見えるかなんていうのは見る人次第なんだから。
Because most things in this world depend entirely on how the viewer perceives them.

274
00:41:03,697 --> 00:41:15,757
たとえばアキロゼのこの格好が、芸術的に見えるかセクシーに見えるかはあなたたち次第みたいなね♪ふふ
For instance, whether Aki Rosenthal's outfit looks artistic or sexy is entirely up to you guys... Fufu~

275
00:41:16,417 --> 00:41:18,357
え、あー、うん。
Eh, ah... yeah.

276
00:41:19,177 --> 00:41:26,757
そうだ！せっかくこうして出会えたんだから、いっしょに踊ろっか？あなたとアキロゼの二人で。
That's right! Since we finally met like this, how about we dance together? Just you and Aki Rosenthal.

277
00:41:27,377 --> 00:41:31,977
え、でも私、踊ったことなんてないんだけど。
Eh, but I've never danced before...

278
00:41:32,957 --> 00:41:41,257
大丈夫大丈夫！これはあなたの為だけに考えた、踊りっ子アキロゼの「振り付け」だからね？
It's okay, it's okay! This is a choreography I thought up just for you, courtesy of dancing Aki Rosenthal, okay?

279
00:41:42,757 --> 00:41:44,417
ね？ふふ
Right? Fufu~

280
00:42:15,517 --> 00:42:22,717
音の鳴らない大地に 恋の歌響けば
If a song of love echoes across the silent earth...

281
00:42:23,117 --> 00:42:31,717
黒い歯車 運命が弾けた
The black gears of fate snap and shatter.

282
00:42:35,117 --> 00:42:39,717
蘇る 遥かいにしえより
Reviving from the distant past,

283
00:42:39,717 --> 00:42:45,517
寂漠の 恋目覚めた
A desolate love awakens.

284
00:42:45,517 --> 00:42:53,517
絆を求めて 炎は走り出す
Seeking bonds, the flames start to race.

285
00:42:58,117 --> 00:43:02,317
儚いと 再生誓った
Vowing ephemeral rebirth,

286
00:43:02,317 --> 00:43:13,717
気高き君の呪縛を
Breaking free from your noble curse...

287
00:43:37,517 --> 00:43:44,517
褪せた青い魂 嘘もなげだして
Cast aside even the lies of a faded blue soul,

288
00:43:44,517 --> 00:43:55,917
現代も抱えて 歪な恋も愚かさも
Embracing the present era, distorted love, and foolishness alike—

289
00:43:57,317 --> 00:44:05,317
突き破り 今二人照らす
Breaking through to illuminate the two of us now.

290
00:44:06,317 --> 00:44:15,117
架空の物語 時が重ねられた
A fictional story stacked layer upon layer through time.

291
00:44:15,617 --> 00:44:24,917
絆の行方を 両手で抱きしめた
I embraced the destination of our bond in both hands.

292
00:44:25,517 --> 00:44:34,617
終わりと始まり 瞬く君の記憶
The end and the beginning—your flickering memories.

293
00:45:18,094 --> 00:45:21,874
絆も求めて
Seeking even bonds,

294
00:45:21,874 --> 00:45:26,974
この馬は走り出す
this beast begins to run.

295
00:45:27,494 --> 00:45:32,774
果ていと再生隔たき
Reborn across the distant limits,

296
00:45:32,774 --> 00:45:36,534
君の十束
your ten-handspan...

297
00:45:36,838 --> 00:45:39,638
絆も
Bonds too,

298
00:45:39,638 --> 00:45:45,638
行く手を両手で抱きしめた
embracing our path ahead with both hands.

299
00:45:46,138 --> 00:45:50,938
終わりと始まり
An ending and a beginning,

300
00:45:51,138 --> 00:45:56,638
遠き君の記憶
your distant memories.

301
00:46:39,780 --> 00:46:47,010
[Text: どこか懐かしい誰かと出会う度に、頭に浮かぶ映像が鮮明になってくる]
[Text: Every time I meet someone vaguely familiar, the images in my head become clearer.]

302
00:46:47,500 --> 00:46:51,490
[Text: もう少しで……何かがわかりそうな気がした]
[Text: I felt like I was just a little closer to understanding something.]

303
00:46:53,337 --> 00:46:56,187
それって、「ライブ」なんじゃないかな？
Could that be a "live concert"?

304
00:46:56,717 --> 00:46:57,587
「ライブ」？
"A live concert"?

305
00:46:57,667 --> 00:47:07,927
うん。私、旅人だから噂で聞いたことがあるんだけど「オングク」があった頃には、よく開催されてたんだって。
Yeah. I'm a traveler, so I've heard rumors that back when "music" existed, they used to hold them a lot.

306
00:47:08,797 --> 00:47:15,517
……そうだ。あたしは「ライブ」をやっていたんだ……。
...That's right. I used to do "live concerts"...

307
00:47:16,427 --> 00:47:21,297
ねぇ、気になるなら今から私と一緒になんかやってみる？
Hey, if you're curious, wanna try doing something with me right now?

308
00:47:21,817 --> 00:47:22,417
え？
Eh?

309
00:47:23,077 --> 00:47:28,427
ていうかやろうよ！あなたとならやってみたい！「ライブ」ってやつを！
I mean, let's do it! I want to try it with you! That thing called a "live concert"!

310
00:47:35,138 --> 00:47:39,638
遠くで聞こえる
Heard from afar,

311
00:47:40,638 --> 00:47:45,138
私を呼ぶ声
a voice calling out to me.

312
00:47:46,138 --> 00:47:56,638
あなたの涙の理由を知ってたはずなのに
Even though I should have known the reason for your tears,

313
00:47:57,638 --> 00:48:03,438
乾く前に 枯れる前に
before they dry up, before they wither away,

314
00:48:03,638 --> 00:48:09,638
全て捧げようと
I wanted to offer everything

315
00:48:10,638 --> 00:48:15,638
あなたにだけ
only to you.

316
00:48:21,638 --> 00:48:27,138
なにを求めるのか 誰を愛するのかさえ
What are we searching for? Who are we even loving?

317
00:48:27,638 --> 00:48:31,638
わからず
Without even knowing...

318
00:48:32,638 --> 00:48:37,138
灰のように朽ちていく心に
To a heart decaying like ash,

319
00:48:37,638 --> 00:48:42,638
あなたの欠片だけは
only your fragment

320
00:48:43,638 --> 00:48:51,638
手探りでもかたちをなぞれば長い眠りの中
if I trace its shape, even groping in the dark, amidst the long slumber,

321
00:48:52,638 --> 00:48:58,638
あなたを夢見るでしょう
I will dream of you.

322
00:48:59,638 --> 00:49:03,638
見慣れたあの日々を何度も
Those familiar days we shared, over and over,

323
00:49:04,138 --> 00:49:09,638
夜明けはあなたにだけ
the dawn belongs only to you.

324
00:49:10,138 --> 00:49:16,138
空にはもう果てがないから
Because the sky has no end anymore.

325
00:49:27,638 --> 00:49:35,638
なにを求めるのか 遠い日のわたしにいま問いかけ
What did I search for? I ask my past self now,

326
00:49:37,638 --> 00:49:42,638
砕かれ色褪せ落ちてく
shattered, fading, and falling away,

327
00:49:43,638 --> 00:49:48,638
あの欠片たちはどこへ――
where do those fragments go...

328
00:51:11,768 --> 00:51:16,008
[Text: 光の塔はもう目の前に迫っていた]
[Text: The Tower of Light was already looming right before us.]

329
00:51:16,668 --> 00:51:22,788
[Text: それにつれて、頭に浮かぶ映像はさらに鮮明になってきていた]
[Text: Along with that, the images in my mind were becoming even more vivid.]

330
00:51:23,668 --> 00:51:26,788
[Text: まるで夢から覚めるように]
[Text: As if waking up from a dream,]

331
00:51:27,288 --> 00:51:32,788
[Text: まるでそれが本物であるかのように]
[Text: As if that were reality itself,]

332
00:51:33,288 --> 00:51:36,428
[Text: ――「ライブ」をしていた場所が]
[Text: --The place where the live concert was held...]

333
00:51:37,688 --> 00:51:39,988
[Text: ……着いた。]
[Text: ...We've arrived.]

334
00:51:40,588 --> 00:51:43,948
[Text: ここが……光の塔。]
[Text: This is... the Tower of Light.]

335
00:51:44,388 --> 00:51:49,088
[Text: 塔っていうよりも、何かの舞台みたいにも見えるな。]
[Text: Rather than a tower, it looks almost like some kind of stage.]

336
00:51:49,628 --> 00:51:52,568
[Text: 似てる……気がする。]
[Text: I feel like... it resembles it.]

337
00:51:53,188 --> 00:51:56,028
[Text: あの、『ライブ』をやってた場所に。]
[Text: That place where the live concert was held.]

338
00:51:57,328 --> 00:51:59,908
[Text: いらっしゃい、ライオンさん]
[Text: Welcome, Lion-san.]

339
00:52:00,388 --> 00:52:06,848
[Text: キミが……願いを叶えてくれる、“天使”？]
[Text: Are you... the angel who grants wishes?]

340
00:52:07,188 --> 00:52:11,068
[Text: うん。そう。キミが来るのを待ってたよ。]
[Text: Yeah. That's right. I've been waiting for you to come.]

341
00:52:11,768 --> 00:52:18,588
[Text: この世界に……「オンガク」を取り戻すことができるキミを。]
[Text: Waiting for you, the one who can bring back music to this world.]

342
00:52:19,148 --> 00:52:22,448
[Text: 「オンガク」を、あたしが……？]
[Text: Me... bringing back music?]

343
00:52:22,748 --> 00:52:24,508
[Text: ふふ、そうだよ。]
[Text: Hehe, that's right.]

344
00:52:25,028 --> 00:52:32,488
[Text: ここに来るまでにたくさんのものを受け取ったキミは、もう「オンガク」が何か分かってるんじゃないかな？]
[Text: Having received so many things on your way here, don't you already know what music is?]

345
00:52:33,028 --> 00:52:35,908
[Text: ほら、ボクといっしょに跳ぼう――]
[Text: Come on, let's leap together――]

346
00:52:46,856 --> 00:52:54,156
[Title: Asphodelus]

347
00:53:04,977 --> 00:53:13,887
目覚めよう 光さす闇の中で 震えを隠し 探り合う二人よ
Let us awake, within the light-piercing darkness, hiding our tremors, two souls searching for one another...

348
00:53:18,577 --> 00:53:26,357
囚われた絶望の縁で 私を抱きしめてください
At the edge of imprisoned despair, please hold me tight...

349
00:53:26,967 --> 00:53:35,067
静寂に埋め尽くされて ひとりだけで凍えている
Completely buried in silence, freezing all alone...

350
00:53:35,957 --> 00:53:44,397
ずれ落ちてゆく楽園の果てで 忘れられた祈りが響いてる
At the end of the slipping paradise, a forgotten prayer echoes...

351
00:53:44,797 --> 00:53:52,477
支配する闇の中でも 枯れない愛を目覚めさせよう
Even within the ruling darkness, let us awaken an unwithering love...

352
00:53:59,497 --> 00:54:07,757
永遠に降る孤独を その指で染めてください
Please dye the endless falling solitude with your fingers...

353
00:54:08,347 --> 00:54:15,907
叫ぶこの心が 悲しみを愛せるように
So that this shouting heart can embrace its sorrow...

354
00:54:19,547 --> 00:54:27,697
まだ見ぬあの光の景色へ…
Toward that yet-unseen scenery of light...

355
00:54:33,907 --> 00:54:42,637
目覚めよう 光さす闇の中で 震えを隠し 探り合う二人よ
Let us awake, within the light-piercing darkness, hiding our tremors, two souls searching for one another...

356
00:54:47,147 --> 00:54:55,067
乱れ咲く花のように 深く優しく口づけてください
Like flowers blooming wildly, please kiss me deeply and tenderly...

357
00:54:55,957 --> 00:55:01,007
カメラの吐息さえも いのち…
Even the camera's sigh, life itself...

358
00:55:02,185 --> 00:55:04,685
傷ついたことも知ってく
Knowing even the scars...

359
00:55:05,035 --> 00:55:06,935
虹のまぼろし
A rainbow illusion,

360
00:55:07,035 --> 00:55:13,685
祝福の風を その温もり二人伝えるまで
until the blessing wind and that warmth are conveyed between the two of us.

361
00:55:13,985 --> 00:55:19,835
走り出す 嵐の中も
Start running even through the storm,

362
00:55:19,835 --> 00:55:22,835
やまない愛を目覚めよ
awaken an unceasing love!

363
00:55:23,135 --> 00:55:26,935
あがえぬ胸の痛みを
Please accept this inescapable

364
00:55:26,935 --> 00:55:28,835
受け止めてください
pain in my chest.

365
00:55:28,935 --> 00:55:35,835
出会えた喜びにとり震える肌の心で
With a trembling skin and heart caught in the joy of meeting you,

366
00:55:35,935 --> 00:55:39,835
出会へと 喜びの
...seeking to fulfill

367
00:55:39,835 --> 00:55:45,735
震えてる素肌の心で 求める
that cruelty with a trembling heart...

368
00:55:46,035 --> 00:55:53,335
その残酷の叶えたい
I want to make it come true.

369
00:55:56,235 --> 00:56:04,835
飛び交い 交差する巡り会う祈りよ
Intersecting, crossing prayers that meet again...

370
00:56:10,335 --> 00:56:20,835
果てしなく 日々に照らされて繋がるの 伸ばす平手
Endlessly illuminated by the days, we connect and stretch out our hands.

371
00:56:21,685 --> 00:56:29,335
ここに散る 涙がキラキラと風に舞う頃
When the tears scattered here dance sparkling in the wind,

372
00:56:29,835 --> 00:56:40,835
絆を 瞳をください 永遠にいえないように
give me bonds and eyes, so they may never fade away eternally.

373
00:56:41,685 --> 00:56:50,335
無限に降る孤独を 私に預けてください
Please entrust the endlessly falling solitude to me.

374
00:56:50,835 --> 00:57:00,335
呼び合えた心が 扉を放ち放たれて
The hearts that called out to each other open the door and are set free.

375
00:57:00,835 --> 00:57:11,335
近づく あの始まりの備えへ
Approaching that preparation for the beginning...

376
00:57:11,835 --> 00:57:23,835
飛び交い 交差する巡り会う祈りよ
Intersecting, crossing prayers that meet again...

377
00:57:46,035 --> 00:58:00,835
獅白ぼたん: へぇー、この街の露天は品揃えがいいな。他では見ない珍しいものがいっぱある。旅を続けてると、やっぱりどうしても装備品は必要になってくるからな……
Shishiro Botan: Hmm, this town's street stalls have a great selection. There's a lot of rare stuff you don't see elsewhere. When you keep traveling, equipment naturally becomes necessary after all...

378
00:58:01,635 --> 00:58:03,535
獅白ぼたん: ちょっと覗いていこ。
Shishiro Botan: Let's take a quick look.

379
00:58:04,335 --> 00:58:07,835
獅白ぼたん: あ、これいいな。「ブランケットインクッション」
Shishiro Botan: Ah, this is nice. "Blanket in Cushion."

380
00:58:08,135 --> 00:58:23,835
獅白ぼたん: ブランケットなのに袋に収納すればクッションになるから、これがあればどこでもひっそり寝できて、旅のおトムにぴったりかも。コンパクトなのにふかふかで、寝心地もよさそう。収納袋の絵もいい感じ。
Shishiro Botan: It's a blanket that turns into a cushion when stored in its bag, so having this means you can take a quiet nap anywhere—might be the perfect companion for a journey. It's compact yet fluffy, and looks comfortable to sleep on. The drawing on the storage bag is nice, too.

381
00:58:26,335 --> 00:58:44,335
獅白ぼたん: こっちは何だろう？「SSRBミニウォレット」か……買い物したり小物を収納するのに財布は必需品なんだよね。小銭もお札も入れられるっていうのも嬉しいな。今使ってるのも古くなってきたし、そろそろ買い替えてもいいかも。
Shishiro Botan: What's this? An "SSRB Mini Wallet"... A wallet is a must-have for shopping and storing small items. It's also great that it can hold both coins and bills. The one I'm using is getting old, so it might be about time to replace it.

382
00:58:44,835 --> 00:59:00,835
獅白ぼたん: お、この「ブレスレット」、かっこいい。デザインが馴染みやすいから普段使いしやすそうだし、ライオンの加護もついてるんだー。これを付けてたらキミもライオンになれるかも……なーんて。
Shishiro Botan: Oh, this "Bracelet" looks cool. The design is easy to get used to so it seems good for everyday wear, and it even comes with a lion's protection. Wearing this might even turn you into a lion... Just kidding.

383
00:59:01,835 --> 00:59:22,835
獅白ぼたん: ふふ、これかわいいな。ヘルメット被ってる。「SSRBぬいぐるみキーホルダー」……付けてるだけですっごく楽しい気分になれそう。手のひらサイズの間口良い大きさだからバックパックにぶら下げてもいいし、ベルトに付けるのもありかな。これも買っとこっと。
Shishiro Botan: Hehe, this is cute. It's wearing a helmet. An "SSRB Plush Keychain"... Just attaching it seems like it would put you in a super fun mood. It's a good palm-sized dimension so you can hang it on a backpack, or maybe attach it to your belt. I'll buy this too.

384
00:59:23,685 --> 00:59:51,835
獅白ぼたん: どうしよう、全部欲しい……どれにするか迷う……え、これを全部まとめたセットもあるんだ？しかもそれだと、収納袋の絵を描いてるトマリ先生の書き下ろしのポストカードと、直筆サイン、白押メッセージが特典でついてくるのか……うーん……セットでください。
Shishiro Botan: What should I do, I want all of them... I can't decide which one to choose... Eh, there's a set that bundles all of these together? What's more, that comes with a postcard illustrated specially by Tomari-sensei (who drew the storage bag art), plus a handwritten signature and stamped message as a bonus... Hmm... I'll take the set, please.

385
00:59:56,335 --> 01:00:05,835
獅白ぼたん: ……やっとわかった気がする。AZKi、見よ……わたね……
Shishiro Botan: ...I feel like I finally understand. AZKi, look... Watame...

386
01:00:07,418 --> 01:00:11,298
ラオーラ、アキロゼ、リオナ……
Raora, Aki Rosenthal, Riona...

387
01:00:12,818 --> 01:00:20,298
かなた……そしてこの舞台に向けて声を届けてくれたたくさんのみんな……
Kanata... and all of you who sent your voices to this stage...

388
01:00:21,658 --> 01:00:27,078
みんなから受け取ったたくさんのもの……そこ込められた想い、
Everything I received from all of you... all the feelings put into it,

389
01:00:27,958 --> 01:00:31,978
それらが詰まって……「オンガク」になる。
All of that comes together... to become "music."

390
01:00:33,178 --> 01:00:36,938
――新しいあたしが生まれるんだ。
--A new me is born.

391
01:00:37,858 --> 01:00:41,498
うん、キミならそう言ってくれると思った。
Yeah, I knew you'd say that.

392
01:00:42,538 --> 01:00:48,158
そんなキミにボクから、ボクたちから……最後に「曲」を贈るよ。
To you, from me, from all of us... I'll dedicate this final "song" to you.

393
01:00:48,918 --> 01:00:58,398
今日という素敵な日の最後を飾る……新しい獅白ぼたんの誕生を祝う、世界で一つだけの「曲」。
A one-of-a-kind "song" in the world, celebrating the birth of the new Shishiro Botan, as a grand finale to this wonderful day.

394
01:00:58,678 --> 01:01:04,518
今のキミなら歌えるはず。『音楽』を取り戻せるはずだから！
With who you are now, you can sing it. Because you can reclaim "music"!

395
01:01:24,433 --> 01:01:28,873
がおってこ！ がおってこ！ がおってこ！ がおってこ！
Let's go roar! Let's go roar! Let's go roar! Let's go roar!

396
01:01:28,873 --> 01:01:36,413
15分早起きした 奇跡的な起床記録 珍しい誇らしい朝 誰のせいでしょうか
Waking up 15 minutes early, a miraculous wakeup record. Such a rare, proud morning, whose fault could it be?

397
01:01:38,953 --> 01:01:44,453
きみのがおが聞こえると 気がするだけかもしれないけど
When I hear your roar, even if it might just be my imagination,

398
01:01:44,893 --> 01:01:49,633
無敵になる気がして 走って走って走れんだ
I feel invincible, running and running and running on.

399
01:01:49,633 --> 01:01:52,073
Shine on! どこで迷っちゃっても
Shine on! Even if I get lost anywhere,

400
01:01:52,073 --> 01:01:56,173
Ride on! 合図は遠くの声 迎えるよ We're Lions!!
Ride on! The signal is a voice from afar, welcoming us. We're Lions!!

401
01:02:00,133 --> 01:02:04,973
きみがいる世界が 輝く合言葉 がおっていいじゃんみんなで
The world where you are shines with our password. It's totally fine to roar together with everyone!

402
01:02:07,273 --> 01:02:09,553
Everybody, say! 1-2-3!!

403
01:02:10,193 --> 01:02:14,873
がおってこ がおってこ ひとりじゃないって魔法かけたら
Let's roar, let's roar. Once you cast the spell that you're not alone,

404
01:02:15,433 --> 01:02:20,553
がおってこ がおってこ 不安だって一緒に吠えて
Let's roar, let's roar. Howl your anxieties together with me,

405
01:02:21,333 --> 01:02:25,573
がおってこ がおってこ 笑顔でバフかけちゃえるから
Let's roar, let's roar. Because we can buff ourselves with smiles!

406
01:02:26,513 --> 01:02:31,473
がおってこ がおってこ ここがそう 私たちの最高
Let's roar, let's roar. This is truly our peak!

407
01:02:32,093 --> 01:02:38,913
Rawr rawr!! Yeah!

408
01:02:41,593 --> 01:02:46,193
一日一獅子Motivation 低めのやる気がおで上昇
One lion a day, motivation. Low-key drive rising up,

409
01:02:46,973 --> 01:02:51,553
Join us my peeps! 百獣で優勝 だからがおっていきましょう
Join us my peeps! Winning with all beasts, so let's keep roaring onward!

410
01:02:51,873 --> 01:02:56,773
靴ずれした右足が 今のやる気を持っていった
My blistered right foot took away today's motivation.

411
01:02:57,233 --> 01:03:01,713
イスの角も小指も ついでにしばいてくれた
The corner of the chair and my pinky toe got beaten up too.

412
01:03:02,313 --> 01:03:07,273
きみのがおが聞こえると そんな日もちょっとやさしくなる
When I hear your roar, even days like that become a bit kinder,

413
01:03:07,633 --> 01:03:12,573
おすそわけしたくて 踊って踊って踊ってんだ
Wanting to share it with you, dancing and dancing and dancing away!

414
01:03:13,173 --> 01:03:17,793
がおってこ がおってこ ジャンプするなら今しかないし
Let's roar, let's roar. If we're going to jump, now is the only time!

415
01:03:18,773 --> 01:03:23,873
がおってこ がおってこ 高いトコ目指しちゃおうよ Let's go!
Let's roar, let's roar. Let's aim for higher places, Let's go!

416
01:03:24,373 --> 01:03:26,453
Shine on! この一瞬がプレゼント
Shine on! This single moment is a present.

417
01:03:27,313 --> 01:03:31,513
Ride on! なぜか真面じゃ言えない
Ride on! For some reason I can't say it seriously,

418
01:03:31,513 --> 01:03:33,593
から吠えちゃうな We're Lions!!
So I end up barking falsely. We're Lions!!

419
01:03:34,813 --> 01:03:39,533
Shine on! きみがいる毎日が 歌う合言葉
Shine on! Every day you're here is our singing password.

420
01:03:40,013 --> 01:03:42,573
Ride on! がおっていいじゃんみんなで
Ride on! It's totally fine to roar together with everyone!

421
01:03:42,573 --> 01:03:44,793
Everybody, say! 1-2-3!!

422
01:03:45,433 --> 01:03:49,873
がおってこ がおってこ 小声でもSayちゃんと聞こえてる
Let's roar, let's roar. Even in a whisper, Say, I can hear you clearly!

423
01:03:50,733 --> 01:03:54,873
がおってこ がおってこ じゃあ叫んだら未来に届く!?
Let's roar, let's roar. Then if we shout, will it reach the future!?

424
01:03:55,513 --> 01:03:59,853
がおってこ がおってこ みんなでなら446dB
Let's roar, let's roar. Together with everyone, it's 446 dB!

425
01:04:00,693 --> 01:04:05,553
がおってこ がおってこ ここがそう 私たちの最高
Let's roar, let's roar. This is truly our peak!

426
01:04:06,213 --> 01:04:15,433
Rawr rawr!! Yeah!

427
01:04:16,393 --> 01:04:21,573
言葉にすると真っ直ぐ過ぎて くすぐったい胸の奥だから
Putting it into words is too direct, tickling deep inside my chest,

428
01:04:22,153 --> 01:04:26,973
がおってこ がおってこ 「ありがとう」のかわりを
Let's roar, let's roar. In place of "thank you,"

429
01:04:27,373 --> 01:04:32,153
がおってこ がおってこ ここがそう 私たちの最高
Let's roar, let's roar. This is truly our peak!

430
01:04:32,153 --> 01:04:43,513
Rawr rawr!! Yeah!

431
01:04:54,088 --> 01:04:59,368
これは……あたしが見てる夢？それとも……
Is this... a dream I'm seeing? Or is it...

432
01:07:17,407 --> 01:07:22,107
(次にあたしが生まれるのは、どこなんだろう)
(Where will I be born next?)

433
01:07:22,107 --> 01:07:26,807
(でもそれがどこでも大丈夫)
(But wherever it is, it'll be fine)

434
01:07:26,807 --> 01:07:30,107
(さようならは言わない)
(I won't say goodbye)

435
01:07:30,107 --> 01:07:39,407
(きっとあたしはこの幸せな物語を胸に、どこまでだって飛べるはずだから)
(Because I'm sure I can fly anywhere with this happy story in my heart)

436
01:07:39,407 --> 01:07:48,807
(--そこに「音楽」と、みんなからもらった温かくてやさしい想いがあれば！)
(As long as I have music and the warm, gentle feelings I received from everyone!)

437
01:07:48,807 --> 01:07:56,807
次の世界で、また会おう……
きみがいる世界で──！
Let's meet again in the next world...
In the world where you are──!

438
01:07:57,356 --> 01:08:03,456
[Text: 新しい世界に旅立つ？]
[Text: Set off for a new world?]

439
